[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21600.59, "timestamp": "06:00:00", "text": "知道。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21603.51, "timestamp": "06:00:03", "text": "嗯，这就像一场挑战或战斗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21605.11, "timestamp": "06:00:05", "text": "之间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21607.51, "timestamp": "06:00:07", "text": "呃，这些呃，它就像一个b，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21610.548, "timestamp": "06:00:10", "text": "正义平衡之类的东西，对吧？那个呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21613.788, "timestamp": "06:00:13", "text": "转换之类的东西，呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21616.548, "timestamp": "06:00:16", "text": "那个东西叫什么来着？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21620.23, "timestamp": "06:00:20", "text": "正义，呃，那金色的圣杯，不是圣杯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21623.19, "timestamp": "06:00:23", "text": "金色的小东西，平衡的东西，物体，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21626.31, "timestamp": "06:00:26", "text": "这就像在保持……之间取得平衡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21628.39, "timestamp": "06:00:28", "text": "良好的印象和负面的印象"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21631.19, "timestamp": "06:00:31", "text": "印象之类的东西，好吧，我要走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21633.75, "timestamp": "06:00:33", "text": "我暂时告辞了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21636.23, "timestamp": "06:00:36", "text": "还有些工作要做，有件事要做，有你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21639.628, "timestamp": "06:00:39", "text": "你就说“好”，然后你就这么做了，这就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21643.03, "timestamp": "06:00:43", "text": "确实可以，但是如何启动呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21646.39, "timestamp": "06:00:46", "text": "之后第二天或之后的谈话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21649.15, "timestamp": "06:00:49", "text": "还有别的什么，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21653.19, "timestamp": "06:00:53", "text": "正确的？如果你接近某人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21656.23, "timestamp": "06:00:56", "text": "嗯，为了你需要的东西，你变成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21659.35, "timestamp": "06:00:59", "text": "你很容易被贴上“需要帮助的人”的标签。"}]